1
00:00:00,249 --> 00:00:05,726
 ikh, ikh antshuldik zikh. ikh, ikh muz zogn vegn eyn epizod,

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,139
az nayntsn akht un draysik

3
00:00:08,230 --> 00:00:10,820
iz mir gevo- ze'mir gevor gevorn in KRAKOW

4
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:13,337
az se kumt a eshelon fun Daytshland,

5
00:00:13,427 --> 00:00:16,644
vos eltere mentshn, froyen un mener,

6
00:00:16,853 --> 00:00:21,583
 UNK brengt, brengt, brengt men zey tsu der poylisher grenets.

7
00:00:21,583 --> 00:00:24,120
fun KRAKOW keyn Katevits,

8
00:00:24,227 --> 00:00:27,354
in KRÓLEWSKA HUTA, Katevits, Shlezyen,

9
00:00:27,354 --> 00:00:31,940
iz a mehalekh mistam fun tsvey hundert kilometer. ze'mir gekumen tsu forn ahin a sakh yidn,

10
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:34,534
un oykhet in di shtet hobn gevoynt zeyer a sakh yidn.

11
00:00:34,534 --> 00:00:36,602
iz ongekumen take a eshelon

12
00:00:36,602 --> 00:00:39,555
bay der grenets un yunge daytshn...

13
00:00:39,555 --> 00:00:42,525
a sakh zenen zey geven brunetn, enlekh tsu yidn...

14
00:00:42,525 --> 00:00:45,469
yunge akhtsn-yerike Hitler-yugnt mit shtekenes:

15
00:00:45,469 --> 00:00:47,322
"RAUS, JUDEN! RAUS, JUDEN!"

16
00:00:47,363 --> 00:00:52,920
un m'hot aroysgetribn bay di zeks hundert yidn, oysgetun biz der helft naket,

17
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:55,811
un oyf der pleytse oysgeshnitn a haknkreyts.

18
00:00:55,902 --> 00:00:58,933
di mentshn zenen geven faryomert mit geveyn,

19
00:00:59,023 --> 00:01:01,796
on shikh, in eyn shukh un UNK shukh.

20
00:01:01,796 --> 00:01:03,911
yeder hot genemen a mentsh.

21
00:01:04,643 --> 00:01:09,986
polyakim afile zenen geshtanen... dort iz geven a shtarke komunistishe PARTEI, nayntsn akht un draysik...

22
00:01:10,110 --> 00:01:13,450
un yidn m⟨it⟩ ⟨UNK⟩s. m'hot tsuzamengenemen gelt,

23
00:01:13,450 --> 00:01:16,975
un yeder hot genemen di yidn epes helfn, aheymnemen zey.

24
00:01:16,975 --> 00:01:20,314
ikh hob genemen a hoykhn yid, hot er geheysn ⟨SELINGER⟩.

25
00:01:20,674 --> 00:01:23,992
er hot ibergelozt a fabrik. er hot keynem nisht gehat: eyner aleyn.

26
00:01:23,998 --> 00:01:27,218
hob ikh im gebrakht tsu firn keyn KRAKOW tsu der baleboste.

27
00:01:27,218 --> 00:01:29,547
ikh bin dokh fun Kosev, dos iz Galitsyen,

28
00:01:29,547 --> 00:01:31,181
un KRAKOW iz vayt,

29
00:01:31,204 --> 00:01:33,459
nor ikh fleg forn ahin mit di TEPPICHer.

30
00:01:33,668 --> 00:01:37,090
iz bay der baleboste vu ikh hob gegesn kosher

31
00:01:37,279 --> 00:01:39,174
un ikh hob gehat a dire,

32
00:01:39,174 --> 00:01:43,384
hob ikh im gebrakht ahin un ⟨ikh hob⟩ gezogt der baleboste, "na dir gelt"... kh'hob gehat, ikh bin geven,

33
00:01:43,384 --> 00:01:46,909
ikh hob gekent alts tun. ⟨ikh hob gehat⟩ a sakh, a sakh gelt gehat...

34
00:01:47,202 --> 00:01:50,691
un ⟨m- az zi⟩ zol im koyfn ontsutun, zol im koyfn vesh,

35
00:01:50,691 --> 00:01:54,165
un zol im gebn zeks khadoshim tsu esn, un shpeter vel ikh vayter tsushikn.

36
00:01:54,525 --> 00:01:58,940
hot er mir gezogt, "MEIN UNK SOHN, ICH HABE BIS JETZT NICHT GEWUSST DAS ICH JUDE BIN."

37
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,894
"mayn zun, ikh hob biz aher nisht gevust az ikh bin a yid."

38
00:02:02,338 --> 00:02:04,239
ikh hob shpeter vayter geshikt,

39
00:02:04,296 --> 00:02:07,735
un dem sof, vi azoy ikh bin, kh'hob oyfgehert mit im,

40
00:02:07,735 --> 00:02:09,730
veys ikh... dos iz geven akht un draysik,

41
00:02:09,730 --> 00:02:12,896
un in kurtsn iz gekumen nayntsn nayn un draysik.

42
00:02:13,138 --> 00:02:15,143
nayntsn akht un draysik

43
00:02:15,143 --> 00:02:17,320
hot Hitler genemen Sudetn,

44
00:02:17,543 --> 00:02:21,134
un di narishe polyakim, di bl⟨UNK⟩de polyakim

45
00:02:21,134 --> 00:02:26,669
zenen gegangen helfn a, a, a, a folk

46
00:02:26,669 --> 00:02:29,980
vos zenen, enlekh tsu di polyakim, tshekh⟨im⟩,

47
00:02:30,047 --> 00:02:34,710
a folk vos zenen geven di b- di beste antviklte industryal,

48
00:02:34,710 --> 00:02:36,900
di beste demokratye iz geven dortn.

49
00:02:36,900 --> 00:02:40,540
m'hot koydem geboyt shtiber far di arbetorer, un d- un dernokh di fabrik.

50
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:44,058
zenen di polyakim g⟨UNK⟩ hobn genemen dray rayonen: Bogumin,

51
00:02:44,058 --> 00:02:48,790
⟨Tsheshine⟩ UNK... Bogumin, ⟨Tsheshine⟩... dem dritn gedenk ikh nisht.

52
00:02:48,790 --> 00:02:50,710
ikh bin geven oykh mobilizirt.

53
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:53,980
mir zenen gegangen... di tshekh⟨n⟩ hobn nisht gegebn keyn eyn shos.

54
00:02:53,980 --> 00:02:57,322
zey hobn gekent undz gut gebn petsh; zey zenen geven beser

55
00:02:57,322 --> 00:02:59,657
a sakh oysgeshtat vi di poylishe.

56
00:02:59,916 --> 00:03:02,981
un UNK s'iz ⟨nisht⟩ durkhgegangen a yor tsayt,

57
00:03:03,088 --> 00:03:05,579
hot er gehat gants Tshekhoslovakay

58
00:03:05,586 --> 00:03:07,380
un gants Poyln oykhet.

59
00:03:07,380 --> 00:03:11,318
nu, di milkhome hot er ongehoybn UNK ⟨durkh⟩ Dantsik. ⟨nu, dos⟩ iz geven alts a lign.

60
00:03:11,357 --> 00:03:13,328
di polyakim zenen gelofn,

61
00:03:13,328 --> 00:03:14,726
di GENERÄLE,

62
00:03:14,833 --> 00:03:17,746
un dos militer hot gelaystet a vidershtand.

63
00:03:17,787 --> 00:03:21,780
mir hobn gehaltn zibn un tsvontsik teg Vesterplate...

64
00:03:21,803 --> 00:03:23,748
dos iz nokh Varshe an ort...

65
00:03:23,748 --> 00:03:27,939
ikh bin a artilerist, nor keyn artilerye iz shoyn nisht gevezn. m'hot undz gegebn biksn.

66
00:03:28,435 --> 00:03:32,515
un azoy iz Poyln in a kurtser tsayt gevorn opgevisht

67
00:03:32,515 --> 00:03:35,347
fun der oyberflakh un m'hot es tseteylt oyf tsvey teyln:

68
00:03:35,725 --> 00:03:39,316
eyn teyl iz gekumen tsu Stalinen, di tsveyte teyl iz gevorn

69
00:03:39,316 --> 00:03:43,126
tsu, iz gekumen tsu ⟨di, di,⟩ tsu di daytshn.

70
00:03:43,470 --> 00:03:45,863
di yidishe mishpokhes hobn zikh bamit

71
00:03:45,863 --> 00:03:49,880
khotshbe di kinder aribertsushikn fun Poyln oyf der sovyetisher zayt.

72
00:03:49,883 --> 00:03:54,343
efsher Sovyetn UNK ⟨dokh⟩ a sovyetishe, a sotsyalistishe melukhe,

73
00:03:54,343 --> 00:03:56,239
efsher veln zey blaybn lebn.

74
00:03:56,380 --> 00:04:00,260
toyznter kinder, un a mol mit eltern, zenen durkh Byalistok

75
00:04:00,260 --> 00:04:02,570
gekumen, un az s'hot zikh ongehoybn di milkhome

76
00:04:02,570 --> 00:04:06,347
zenen zey fun, Galitsyen shoyn gekumen tifer keyn Rusland,

77
00:04:06,505 --> 00:04:09,440
hot zikh ongehoybn a pamelekher toyt.

78
00:04:09,576 --> 00:04:12,551
kinder yidishe, zekhtsn, akhtsn yor,

79
00:04:12,551 --> 00:04:15,950
hot men genemen in ST- ⟨, di⟩ STROYBATn, di,

80
00:04:15,950 --> 00:04:19,323
in di, arbeter-, dos.

81
00:04:19,329 --> 00:04:24,570
un di vos zey hobn badarft gebn dos, di, di zeyf in di fesl,

82
00:04:24,570 --> 00:04:28,190
aza, azoy vi, gedikht, oyf tsu vashn zikh,

83
00:04:28,190 --> 00:04:31,020
hobn fartrunken dos far vodke,

84
00:04:31,020 --> 00:04:33,954
un s'hot zikh ongehoybn tifus, un di kinder zenen gefaln.

85
00:04:34,315 --> 00:04:39,079
undz hot men mobilizirt in der sovyetisher armey nayntsn eyn un fertsik fun Galitsyen

86
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:41,728
ale yidn, polyakim un Ukrayner.

87
00:04:41,728 --> 00:04:47,300
ze'mir nor aribergekumen oyf der alter grenets, hot men undz ale nisht g-, getroyt keyn gever,

88
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:49,969
un m'hot undz oykh geshikt in di lagern.

89
00:04:50,300 --> 00:04:52,907
 stantsye LISKI lebn VORONEZH,

90
00:04:52,907 --> 00:04:55,329
s'iz shoyn gants vayt fun der alter grenets,

91
00:04:55,329 --> 00:04:58,136
hot men gemakht, hot men gevolt makhn a groysn erodrom,

92
00:04:58,159 --> 00:05:02,248
un dort iz geven bay di tsvey toyznt kinder fun kimat yidn,

93
00:05:02,248 --> 00:05:04,717
 k- yidishe kinder fun Poyln,

94
00:05:04,808 --> 00:05:09,730
un mir zenen gekumen ahin. di Ukrayner zenen geven durkhgetribn, mit di polyakim.

95
00:05:09,730 --> 00:05:12,330
zey hobn gevust, az zey veln geyn tsurik aheym,

96
00:05:12,330 --> 00:05:15,309
vet men zey nemen, m'vet zey nit hargenen; zey zenen dokh polyakim.

97
00:05:15,309 --> 00:05:18,260
zenen zey gegangen durkh der grenets. di daytshn hobn zey gekhapt

98
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:20,895
un m'hot zey gefirt in a, oyf arbet keyn Daytshland,

99
00:05:20,895 --> 00:05:22,405
ABER m'hot zey nisht geharget.

100
00:05:22,405 --> 00:05:24,928
di kinder di yidishe hobn nisht gekent geyn tsurik.

101
00:05:24,928 --> 00:05:27,515
dort zenen shoyn geven undzere kdoyshim toyt.

102
00:05:27,673 --> 00:05:29,354
zenen zey geblibn dortn.

103
00:05:29,563 --> 00:05:33,000
yedn tog iz gevorn, ⟨zenen ge-⟩ m'iz gevorn layzik,

104
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:35,390
iz gevorn tifus, un s'iz gevorn,

105
00:05:35,390 --> 00:05:37,508
un s'iz gevorn krankheytn,

106
00:05:37,508 --> 00:05:40,357
un s'iz geven hunderter lagers azelekhe.

107
00:05:40,532 --> 00:05:42,618
i eltere, ale tsuzamen.

108
00:05:42,726 --> 00:05:45,842
ikh hob dos tsugekukt mit di, mit mayne oygn

109
00:05:45,949 --> 00:05:48,477
un hob gezen zeyer a troyerikn fal:

110
00:05:48,477 --> 00:05:51,709
fun Rumenyen iz ⟨geven⟩ oykh mobilizirt Spivakov,

111
00:05:51,709 --> 00:05:54,364
a rus, geboyrn in Rumenyen,

112
00:05:54,505 --> 00:05:58,890
un er iz geven a komunist, take a, an oyfrikhtiker, a guter komunist.

113
00:05:58,890 --> 00:06:02,919
hot er gezogt dem, onfirer fun K.G.B.,

114
00:06:03,060 --> 00:06:05,638
"az du vest nisht brengen di feslekh mit dem zeyf,

115
00:06:05,638 --> 00:06:08,339
un az du vest nisht firn, az me zol di kinder firn,

116
00:06:08,339 --> 00:06:10,086
me zol ENTLAUSUNG makhn,

117
00:06:10,086 --> 00:06:13,939
vel ikh g- bay dir tsuganven dem pistolet, ikh'l dikh shisn un zikh."

118
00:06:14,097 --> 00:06:18,174
er hot bay im tsugeganvet dem pistolet. er hot im geshosn un er hot zikh geshosn.

119
00:06:18,450 --> 00:06:22,250
zayn froy iz geven a agronom un hot gearbet in a, ⟨in a,⟩

120
00:06:22,250 --> 00:06:25,200
in a ort vu me makht puter. a agronom.

121
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:28,760
fleg zi brengen yede vokh a groys shtik puter. der Spivakov fleg gebn

122
00:06:28,760 --> 00:06:31,213
undzere kinder a shtikele puter, zikh nisht.

123
00:06:31,213 --> 00:06:34,260
un az er hot zikh geshosn ho'mir geveynt vi nokh a tate.

124
00:06:34,260 --> 00:06:37,381
un zi iz gekumen shpeter mit a vokh brengen frish puter,

125
00:06:37,381 --> 00:06:40,196
un er iz shoyn geven toyt, hot zi gerisn fun zikh di hor.

126
00:06:40,354 --> 00:06:43,330
m'hot, di daytshn zenen gekumen nenter.

127
00:06:43,330 --> 00:06:46,659
m'hot undz keyn shum dokumentn nisht gegebn. m'hot gezogt, "gey vu di vilst."

128
00:06:47,070 --> 00:06:49,615
un mir zenen gegangen on papirn,

129
00:06:49,615 --> 00:06:52,954
tsu fus; der daytsh loyft un mir loyfn foroys.

130
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:54,844
ABER mir zenen shoyn geven shvakh,

131
00:06:54,850 --> 00:07:00,380
distrofiks. ze'mir geven layzik, m'hot undz nisht arayngelozt in di SUBWAYen, di vos zey hobn zikh evakuirt.

132
00:07:00,537 --> 00:07:03,006
un azoy ze'mir tsugekumen tsun a SUBWAY,

133
00:07:03,006 --> 00:07:05,537
fregn di yidishe froyen... zenen geven efsher

134
00:07:05,537 --> 00:07:10,082
toyznt froyen UNK zet oys, froyen fun, fun ⟨di⟩ zelner...

135
00:07:10,375 --> 00:07:13,929
iz mir hobn zikh gekratst. zogn zey, "ir zent layzik?" makhn mir, "yo."

136
00:07:14,425 --> 00:07:17,071
hobn zey undz nisht arayngelozt. iz aroysgegan a goye,

137
00:07:17,071 --> 00:07:18,907
zogt zi, "kumt aher, kinderlekh"...

138
00:07:19,065 --> 00:07:21,163
a goye iz oykh geven in dem eshelon...

139
00:07:21,163 --> 00:07:24,200
un hot undz gegebn naye ontsutun, fun layvnt.

140
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:27,564
mir hobn alts UNK farbrent, ⟨un⟩ ze'mir gekumen biz Kazakhstan

141
00:07:27,925 --> 00:07:32,360
mit dem. mir hobn gehelfn di yidishe froyen zikh oys- aroy- fun dortn aroysgeyn.

142
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:35,006
Kazakhstan iz shoyn shtark vayt, s'iz shoyn a respublik.

143
00:07:35,164 --> 00:07:36,558
fun dor- fun dort

144
00:07:36,649 --> 00:07:41,030
ze- bin ikh geforn in der poylisher armey Sikorski,

145
00:07:41,121 --> 00:07:46,650
 un, Anders. Sikorskin hot men geharget, UNK geheysn shoyn Anders.

146
00:07:46,650 --> 00:07:48,760
dort vu m'hot dem dokter Gertner geharget.

147
00:07:48,760 --> 00:07:51,647
⟨e⟩rnokh iz gekumen di, VANDA VASILEVSKAYA

148
00:07:51,647 --> 00:07:56,285
un hot undz avekgefirt, un m'hot organizirt di divizye in nomen fun TADEUSZ KOŚCIUSZKO.

149
00:07:56,342 --> 00:07:59,795
Anders, iz er geven a groyser antisemit?

150
00:07:57,270 --> 00:07:57,837
A-...

151
00:07:58,401 --> 00:08:01,567
Anders iz gevezn der fartreter fun Sikorskin,

152
00:08:01,471 --> 00:08:02,471
BUT...

153
00:08:01,590 --> 00:08:04,891
i- iz er gevorn der, der onfirer.

154
00:08:04,768 --> 00:08:07,946
ober iz er geven a groyser antisemit?

155
00:08:08,374 --> 00:08:09,910
ale zenen zey...

156
00:08:08,391 --> 00:08:09,980
veystu?

157
00:08:09,910 --> 00:08:13,630
dort, di armey, Sikors-, dos, iz geven

158
00:08:13,630 --> 00:08:16,901
bafrayte fun di lagers POLIZEI,

159
00:08:16,901 --> 00:08:22,450
 FINOTDEL, a- ale di polyakim vos, Stalin hot zey,

160
00:08:22,450 --> 00:08:25,617
hot zey arestirt f- er hot dokh aroysgelozt fun di lagers.

161
00:08:25,617 --> 00:08:28,618
zey hobn shtark faynt gehat dem komunizm un di rusn,

162
00:08:28,624 --> 00:08:30,367
un derfar hobn zey

163
00:08:30,367 --> 00:08:33,930
fartrunken alts vos Amerike un ⟨ANGL⟩⟨UNK⟩ hot gegebn

164
00:08:33,930 --> 00:08:35,320
ontsutun, di shikh,

165
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:38,750
⟨zey⟩ hobn getrunken vayn. di K.G.B. hot dos gehe- gezen,

166
00:08:38,750 --> 00:08:40,660
hot men gemoldn keyn Moskve.

167
00:08:40,660 --> 00:08:43,868
hot er gezogt, "in dray tog, oyb ir geyt nisht oyf dem front,

168
00:08:43,868 --> 00:08:46,520
oyfn rusishn, farnemt zikh fun danet!"

169
00:08:46,579 --> 00:08:48,632
zenen zey avekgegangen keyn Iran.

170
00:08:48,908 --> 00:08:53,385
mir zenen gekumen ahin vu di V-, di VANDA VASILEVSKAYA hot formirt di divizye

171
00:08:53,385 --> 00:08:55,290
fun TADEUSZ KOŚCIUSZKO.

172
00:08:55,290 --> 00:08:57,794
TADEUSZ KOŚCIUSZKO iz a f- a,

173
00:08:57,801 --> 00:09:02,961
a mentsh velekher hot bafrayt di, di, di land-virtsh- land-virt-arbetorer,

174
00:09:00,617 --> 00:09:01,617
UNK

175
00:09:02,961 --> 00:09:05,720
di KREST'YANSTVO in Poyln.

176
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:08,370
a groyser protsent in der divizye zenen geven yidn.

177
00:09:08,382 --> 00:09:12,723
mir zenen nisht gegangen in der poylisher armey, mir zoln fray makhn Poyln.

178
00:09:12,723 --> 00:09:17,145
mir hobn gekent gants gut az Poyln iz geven THOUSAND yor antisemitish.

179
00:09:17,145 --> 00:09:21,521
mir zenen gegangen gikher aheym, efsher khotshbe lebt emetser fun der mishpokhe,

180
00:09:21,797 --> 00:09:24,120
efsher iz emetser oysbahaltn gevorn,

181
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:26,229
efsher iz emetser geven in vald.

182
00:09:26,235 --> 00:09:28,557
⟨nor⟩ az mir zenen tsugegan biz tsum Bug

183
00:09:28,817 --> 00:09:31,724
un di divizye hot dos ershte mol genemen a onteyl

184
00:09:31,724 --> 00:09:35,021
in ⟨Lenine-Orshe⟩, VITEBSKAYA gubernye,

185
00:09:35,128 --> 00:09:38,598
iz dort shoyn gefaln zeyer a sakh yidn fun der divizye.

186
00:09:38,689 --> 00:09:41,180
un az ⟨mir hobn⟩ shoyn forsirt dem Bug,

187
00:09:41,180 --> 00:09:45,320
⟨un⟩ ze'mir arayngekumen keyn VLODAVA, nokh KHOLM, biz Lublin,

188
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:49,820
di, di, der G- di daytshn zenen shoyn nisht geven azoy shtark vi,

189
00:09:49,820 --> 00:09:51,755
vi in onfang fun der milkhome,

190
00:09:51,755 --> 00:09:55,540
un undz hot untergehaltn di avyatsye di rusishe shtark un a

191
00:09:55,540 --> 00:09:58,514
artilerye a shtarke, un mir zenen gegangen.

192
00:09:58,514 --> 00:10:02,240
s'hot shoyn ongehoybn zikh tsu formirn di ershte armey di poylishe,

193
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:05,950
vayl m'hot ongehoybn tsu nemen polyakim oykhet, velekhe hobn zeyer oft dezertirt,

194
00:10:05,950 --> 00:10:10,478
vayl s'iz gevezn nisht, nisht keyn poylishe armey, mistam a ko- epes a komunistishe...

195
00:10:10,478 --> 00:10:14,630
eyn tog hot men zikh getseylemt, dem andern tog nisht. s'iz nisht geven keyn distsiplin keyn shtarke,

196
00:10:14,630 --> 00:10:18,510
nor di K.G.B. iz gegangen hinter undz, tomer hot emetser gevolt geyn in vald arayn,

197
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:19,911
hot men gekhapt di koyl.

198
00:10:19,911 --> 00:10:23,978
nor di polyakim flegn antloyfn. mir yidn hobn nisht gekent antloyfn in ergets.

199
00:10:23,978 --> 00:10:29,550
a tsveyte zakh, vos, yedn tog, iz gegangen di ende shoyn tsu der milkhome,

200
00:10:29,550 --> 00:10:32,041
ho'mir gehat a meglekhkeyt nekome tsu nemen.

201
00:10:32,048 --> 00:10:33,544
zeyer oft...

202
00:10:33,685 --> 00:10:36,171
un in der poylisher armey iz gevezn

203
00:10:36,171 --> 00:10:38,668
a groyser protsent sovyetishe ofitsirn,

204
00:10:38,668 --> 00:10:40,361
un shpetsyel di K.G.B....

205
00:10:40,536 --> 00:10:43,967
az m'hot badarft, b-, oyshern oyf daytsh

206
00:10:43,967 --> 00:10:47,299
a, di gefangene, di v- vos m'hot zey genemen in plen,

207
00:10:47,299 --> 00:10:50,850
flegn, flegn a sakh yidn, un, un ikh oykh, flegn zogn,

208
00:10:50,850 --> 00:10:53,847
fregn, "vu z- vu ⟨di,⟩ zenen di iberike?" ikh fleg nisht fregn,

209
00:10:53,847 --> 00:10:56,842
"vu zenen bahaltn di, di daytshe militer?"

210
00:10:56,842 --> 00:10:59,447
ikh fleg im fregn, "HAST DU VIELE JUDEN GETÖTET?"

211
00:10:59,773 --> 00:11:02,394
ikh bin shoyn gevezn shtark; s'iz dokh shoyn geven,

212
00:11:02,394 --> 00:11:05,811
mir zenen shoyn gevezn hinter Varshe, ze'mir geshtanen dray khadoshim.

213
00:11:05,811 --> 00:11:08,629
Stalin hot nisht erloybt tsu forsirn di Vaysl,

214
00:11:08,629 --> 00:11:13,670
derfar vayl di polyakim in London hobn gezogt, "mir viln aleyn bafrayen Varshe."

215
00:11:13,670 --> 00:11:15,396
un zey hobn gemakht a oyfshtand,

216
00:11:15,396 --> 00:11:19,159
un mir hobn gezen fun a kloyster, a OBSERVATSIONNYY punkt...

217
00:11:19,159 --> 00:11:20,594
ikh bin dokh a artilerist...

218
00:11:20,594 --> 00:11:24,146
ho'mir gezen vi dos Varshever geto nebekh, di, di letste

219
00:11:24,146 --> 00:11:26,429
vern, oykhet geharget dortn.

220
00:11:26,622 --> 00:11:32,353
zey hobn, di dray hundert toyznt polyakim vos zey hobn gemakht dem oyfshtand... azoy, mer-veyniker, hot men gezogt; ikh veys nisht genoy...

221
00:11:32,511 --> 00:11:35,610
hot men, hot men oysgeharget. densmolt hot Stalin erloybt

222
00:11:35,610 --> 00:11:38,512
tsu forsirn di Varshe. Varshe iz geven tseklapt,

223
00:11:38,704 --> 00:11:42,377
vayl m'hot, mir zenen geshtanen ⟨le-⟩ Rembertov, Vlokhe,

224
00:11:42,450 --> 00:11:45,610
 d- di forshtet fun Varshe,

225
00:11:45,610 --> 00:11:48,722
fun der linker zayt fun der Vaysl, un dernokh hot men forsirt dortn.

226
00:11:49,015 --> 00:11:51,940
farshteyt zikh az di rusishe arm⟨ey⟩

227
00:11:51,940 --> 00:11:55,337
hot zikh bafrayt fun, Y- fun Yapan, fun Sibir,

228
00:11:55,377 --> 00:11:58,729
un m'iz gegangen, ⟨iz⟩ shoyn nisht gevezn dos,

229
00:11:58,802 --> 00:12:01,108
vos s'zenen geven di daytshn fun onheyb on,

230
00:12:01,553 --> 00:12:04,545
⟨nor⟩ di, di yidishe,

231
00:12:04,545 --> 00:12:07,386
di yidishe zelner hobn gehat di meglekhkeyt

232
00:12:07,459 --> 00:12:09,056
nekome tsu nemen.

233
00:12:09,062 --> 00:12:12,988
az me fleg nemen in gefangenshaft, hot er a pistolet, der daytsh,

234
00:12:13,129 --> 00:12:15,809
un me sht⟨e⟩kt arayn di hant in keshene arayn,

235
00:12:15,809 --> 00:12:18,467
nemt men aroys finef, zeks, zibn bilder

236
00:12:18,467 --> 00:12:22,120
vu se shteyt fun Lentshits, Zgerzh, Ozorkov

237
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:26,617
di yidn, mit di kleyne kepkelekh dortn, di, fun Kongres-Poyln,

238
00:12:26,617 --> 00:12:28,294
mit di kinder oyf di hent.

239
00:12:28,350 --> 00:12:31,331
er shist zey un a khaver makht dos bild.

240
00:12:31,489 --> 00:12:34,267
un az ikh nem aroys fun der keshene, freg ikh im,

241
00:12:34,375 --> 00:12:38,236
⟨,⟩ "HUND"... ⟨dos heyst,⟩ SOBAKA, ⟨f-⟩...

242
00:12:38,236 --> 00:12:42,047
"ot di kinder, oto do dray, fir a mishpokhe, finef a mishpokhe"...

243
00:12:42,070 --> 00:12:45,591
un er hot dos geshikt aheym der froy az er iz a giber.

244
00:12:45,664 --> 00:12:48,648
do zenen geven di SONDERKOMMAN⟨D⟩ vos zenen geblibn

245
00:12:48,648 --> 00:12:54,512
nokh dem vi di daytshn hobn opgetret untertsutsinen UNK FACTORIES, di industrye.

246
00:12:54,512 --> 00:12:57,372
nu, me fleg zey dokh khapn, khotsh zey zenen gevezn shtark.

247
00:12:57,372 --> 00:12:59,980
mir zenen shoyn geven shtarker; di, di rusishe armey hot,

248
00:12:59,980 --> 00:13:01,667
fleg shoyn nemen shtet afile

249
00:13:01,667 --> 00:13:05,150
on di, zey hobn nisht gel- gelaystet keyn vide-... KRAKOW bikhlal genemen,

250
00:13:05,150 --> 00:13:06,667
⟨,⟩ m'hot arumgeringlt....

251
00:13:06,876 --> 00:13:09,760
iz, f- hob ikh im gefregt, "⟨zumer⟩,

252
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:14,947
nokh dem ⟨v- v- do-⟩ di kinderlekh, ot di kleyne ⟨vo-⟩ a khoydesh tsvey, oyf di hent bay dem zeyde,

253
00:13:14,947 --> 00:13:16,860
bay dem tate hobn dokh oykh gevolt lebn.

254
00:13:16,860 --> 00:13:20,809
un du vilst lebn? host dokh a pistolet; shis dikh aleyn!" oyf daytsh hob ikh im gezogt.

255
00:13:20,815 --> 00:13:23,171
er shteyt oyf di kni: "shenk mir dos lebn!"

256
00:13:23,346 --> 00:13:24,842
"shenk mir dos lebn!"

257
00:13:25,101 --> 00:13:26,934
ikh hob keyn flig nisht geharget.

258
00:13:26,991 --> 00:13:30,350
az er vil nisht, hob ikh im... zogt der, kolonel

259
00:13:30,350 --> 00:13:34,742
"gey mit im aroys." vayl ikh hob im gegebn a hak mitn pistolet in kop, dos blut geyt,

260
00:13:34,742 --> 00:13:38,072
un er, ⟨,⟩ shteyt mitn konyak in dem...

261
00:13:38,314 --> 00:13:41,650
ot do in CHICAGO, tsurik mit zeks yor,

262
00:13:41,650 --> 00:13:44,805
iz geshtorbn Mortkovitsh, a yid,

263
00:13:44,845 --> 00:13:50,188
un ikh bin gevezn in, oyfn divan in CHAPEL bay der levaye.

264
00:13:50,970 --> 00:13:54,207
fre- gey ikh tsu tsu der froy fun im un freg im,

265
00:13:54,207 --> 00:13:57,169
"Mortkovitsh iz fun lebn Lodzh?" zogt zi, "yo."

266
00:13:57,169 --> 00:13:59,820
"er iz geven in der poylisher armey?" zogt zi, "yo."

267
00:13:59,820 --> 00:14:03,784
er iz geven bay mir DOWÓDCA PLUTONU, in ⟨k-⟩ artilerye.

268
00:14:03,784 --> 00:14:07,114
er hot gehat zibn zelner mit an harmat, bay mir.

269
00:14:07,272 --> 00:14:12,024
er fleg zeyer ⟨t-⟩ oft zogn, "Shimshen, lomikh makhn ⟨ROSH TAKHAS ROSH⟩."

270
00:14:12,823 --> 00:14:15,402
vayl m- mir hobn ni- mir hobn nisht,

271
00:14:15,402 --> 00:14:18,099
tomer hot eyner nisht gehat, tsum bayshpil, keyn,

272
00:14:18,105 --> 00:14:21,676
keyn, keyn klezayen, flegn mir nit rirn.

273
00:14:21,835 --> 00:14:25,612
mir flegn, s'iz geven feler ven der komendant,

274
00:14:25,612 --> 00:14:29,080
der rusisher, in poylishn mundir, m'hot im geharget,

275
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:31,880
fleg mir zogn der kolonel, "zay tsvey, dray tog,

276
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:33,829
un dernokh ⟨vet⟩ kumen a anderer."

277
00:14:33,829 --> 00:14:37,117
fleg men mir untershikn yunge meydelekh daytshe, naket,

278
00:14:37,157 --> 00:14:40,841
broyt. zenen di shtet vos zey hobn, Poyln hot farnemen

279
00:14:40,841 --> 00:14:42,247
UNK geven daytshe,

280
00:14:42,304 --> 00:14:44,222
un zey zenen antlofn.

281
00:14:44,228 --> 00:14:47,988
un s'iz shoyn geven ende di milkhome, nayntsn fir un fertsik ende,

282
00:14:47,988 --> 00:14:50,207
iz gevezn JELENIA GÓRA,

283
00:14:50,207 --> 00:14:52,502
hot dos hey- geheysn HIRSCHBERG,

284
00:14:52,502 --> 00:14:55,590
WAL- WAL-WALBRZYCH, ⟨hot zi geheysn⟩ WALDENBURG.

285
00:14:55,590 --> 00:14:58,222
bin ikh geven tsvey, dray teg der komendant dort fun dem.

286
00:14:58,222 --> 00:15:01,299
fleg men mir araynshikn yunge kinder naket.

287
00:15:01,474 --> 00:15:05,276
 zog ikh dem ORDINARETS vos er fleg mikh badinen, dem zelner,

288
00:15:05,276 --> 00:15:06,970
"gib ir broyt, loz zi geyn.

289
00:15:07,060 --> 00:15:10,423
UNK nisht tun dos vos m'hot getun mit undzere meydlekh,

290
00:15:10,423 --> 00:15:14,717
mit undzere..." di Ukrayner. di daytshn nisht, ABER di Ukrayner flegn fargvaltikn.

291
00:15:14,717 --> 00:15:17,120
zey hobn getun vos zey hobn gevolt mit undzere meydlekh.

292
00:15:17,387 --> 00:15:19,990
azoy arum az, ikh hob UNK...

293
00:15:19,990 --> 00:15:23,357
ruft zikh on bay mir a rusisher ofitsir, nor in poylishn mundir...

294
00:15:23,357 --> 00:15:26,173
s'zenen dokh geven in undzer armey rusishe zeyer a sakh...

295
00:15:26,382 --> 00:15:29,770
zogt er, "ikh'l dikh... aza min kind lozstu aroys?!"

296
00:15:29,770 --> 00:15:34,610
in a tsvey, dray tog ze'mir gevor gevorn az er iz shoyn in a VENERICHESK⟨IY⟩ shpitol,

297
00:15:34,617 --> 00:15:37,474
az er hot kh- gekhapt fun ir a shvere krankheyt,

298
00:15:37,474 --> 00:15:39,218
a venerishe, fun zey.

299
00:15:39,375 --> 00:15:42,224
un s'iz gevezn hinter Berlin SED'MOY LAGER',

300
00:15:42,224 --> 00:15:45,050
der zibeter lager, iz geven dortn efsher fertsik toyznt

301
00:15:45,050 --> 00:15:48,670
i soldatn, i ofitsirn sovyetishe

302
00:15:48,670 --> 00:15:50,577
⟨AN⟩geshtekt fun di,

303
00:15:50,577 --> 00:15:52,939
fun di froyen, oder shpetsyel,

304
00:15:52,939 --> 00:15:56,323
oder m'hot zey gemakht, ⟨,⟩ beyzvilik.

305
00:15:56,323 --> 00:15:59,976
di Amerikaner hobn zikh nisht opgeshtelt keyn mol. di rusn flegn zikh opshteln.

306
00:15:59,976 --> 00:16:02,606
zey hobn gehat vodke un ales, un azoy vayter.

307
00:16:02,848 --> 00:16:06,183
 dos hob ikh g- shpetsyel vegn dem gevolt zogn.

308
00:16:06,223 --> 00:16:09,474
di, zayendik in,

309
00:16:09,514 --> 00:16:14,081
in der poylisher armey ze'mir gekumen biz, ⟨Lenine-Orshe⟩,

310
00:16:14,172 --> 00:16:16,910
 V- Viteb- fun, lebn Vitebsk,

311
00:16:16,910 --> 00:16:20,066
un dernokh hobn mir forsirt, iz geven dortn a sakh korbones

312
00:16:20,066 --> 00:16:21,759
fun undzer divizye.

313
00:16:22,457 --> 00:16:26,383
un dernokh ze'mir shoyn gegangen durkh, VLODAVA, Lublin,

314
00:16:26,423 --> 00:16:30,410
alts mit,... flegn eynts⟨ldik⟩e mentshn,

315
00:16:30,473 --> 00:16:33,810
 mit, farvaksene, opgerisene

316
00:16:33,810 --> 00:16:38,634
yidn aroysgeyn fun vald, un di, di,

317
00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:42,004
di, afile di rusishe ofitsirn flegn zey

318
00:16:42,004 --> 00:16:45,210
oyfzetsn ⟨un me,⟩ un shoyn tsufirn biz tsun a shtot,

319
00:16:45,210 --> 00:16:48,509
gebn zey a bisl gelt dortn, broyt, un azoy vayter, un azoy vayter.

320
00:16:48,509 --> 00:16:50,413
ober zeyer veynik iz geblibn.

321
00:16:50,503 --> 00:16:53,259
UNK durkhgegan durkh mayn Lublin, vu ikh hob a mol

322
00:16:53,259 --> 00:16:56,187
gelernt in der yeshive, vu s'iz gevezn aza min

323
00:16:56,187 --> 00:16:59,486
groyser onfirer vi reb Meyer Shapiro,

324
00:16:59,486 --> 00:17:04,321
velekher iz geshtorbn nayntsn tsvey un draysik, kh'gedenk nisht, oder eyn un draysik.

325
00:17:04,321 --> 00:17:07,029
er iz alt geven zeks un fertsik yor mit akht monat.

326
00:17:07,029 --> 00:17:10,607
s'iz geven zeyer a groyser, a geakhteter

327
00:17:10,607 --> 00:17:12,637
onfirer fun yidishn folk.

328
00:17:12,964 --> 00:17:18,172
un, ⟨az⟩ ze'mir gekumen hinter KRAKOW,

329
00:17:19,107 --> 00:17:21,278
un KRAKOW iz shoyn geven arumgeringlt...

330
00:17:21,823 --> 00:17:26,270
nu, s'iz alts eyns, durkh TARNÓW, durkh, di shtetlekh.

331
00:17:26,270 --> 00:17:30,280
yedn fals, di kamfn zenen gevezn, ober nit azelekhe farbisene vi

332
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:32,485
Stalingrad oder vi di andere dortn,

333
00:17:32,485 --> 00:17:36,113
vu far yeder shtub hot men, hot men gegebn korbones.

334
00:17:36,113 --> 00:17:38,169
ho'mir gemakht an oyneg-shabes.

335
00:17:38,800 --> 00:17:45,780
dos iz gevezn, oder detsember nayntsn fir un fertsik, oder UNK f- finef un fertsik onheyb.

336
00:17:45,887 --> 00:17:47,416
ikh gedenk nisht genoy.

337
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:51,990
ho'mir gemakht a oyneg-shabes. dort iz gevezn KAZIMIERZ.

338
00:17:52,013 --> 00:17:56,017
in KRAKOW iz geven fertsik gasn far Poyln, hobn zey geheysn yidishe nemen.

339
00:17:56,017 --> 00:17:58,010
der gantser miskher iz geven dortn.

340
00:17:58,010 --> 00:17:59,417
far vos KAZIMIERZ?

341
00:17:59,417 --> 00:18:01,434
vayl in der poylisher shul hot men gelernt

342
00:18:01,434 --> 00:18:05,591
az KAZ⟨IMIR⟩ WIELKI hot gebrakht di yidn keyn P-, fun Daytshland keyn Poyln.

343
00:18:05,614 --> 00:18:08,040
Poyln iz geven orem,

344
00:18:08,040 --> 00:18:10,766
un di yidn hobn gemakht a miskher durkh der Vaysl

345
00:18:10,766 --> 00:18:14,082
inem baltishn yam, un Poyln iz gevorn raykh.

346
00:18:14,082 --> 00:18:17,110
"⟨KAZIMIERZ WIELKI SPROWADZIŁ ŻYDÓW DO POLSKI⟩.

347
00:18:17,110 --> 00:18:19,330
⟨POLA-, ŻYDZI ROZWINĘLI HANDEL⟩

348
00:18:19,330 --> 00:18:22,430
⟨PO WIŚLE W MORZE BAŁTYCKIE. POLSKA STAŁA BOGATA.⟩

349
00:18:22,430 --> 00:18:26,397
dos hot gezogt ZAKLIKA, a polyak, a direktor fun der shul.

350
00:18:26,404 --> 00:18:29,818
az ze'mir gekumen in dem KRA- KRAKOW, gedenk ikh dokh, far der milkhome

351
00:18:29,818 --> 00:18:32,760
iz take in di fertsik gasn geven der yidisher miskher,

352
00:18:32,760 --> 00:18:35,640
un di yidn hobn gekent gut dem miskher; zey hobn geha- libersh⟨t⟩

353
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:38,449
hundert koynim gehat tsu eyn sent,

354
00:18:38,449 --> 00:18:42,310
vi eyder eyn koyne far fuftsik sent. di polyakim hobn gevolt UNK

355
00:18:42,310 --> 00:18:44,830
vern raykh, UNK zenen zey gegangen tsu di yidn,

356
00:18:44,830 --> 00:18:46,614
khotshe zey hobn faynt gehat zey.

357
00:18:46,755 --> 00:18:50,008
az ho'mir gemakht dem ⟨oyneg-⟩shabes zenen gekumen rusishe yidn,

358
00:18:50,008 --> 00:18:52,819
un ze'mir geven fun der poylisher armey dortn yidn,

359
00:18:52,819 --> 00:18:56,571
⟨un ho'mir zikh⟩ gevolt freylekh makhn. mir ho'mir getantst oyf der stsene dort in shil.

360
00:18:56,577 --> 00:18:59,844
geyt tsu a meydl, zogt zi, "⟨SZYMEK, TY NIE POZNAJESZ MNIE?⟩"

361
00:18:59,968 --> 00:19:03,168
"du ge- du derkenst mikh nisht?" "⟨ETO JANKA TIRAS⟩."

362
00:19:03,597 --> 00:19:05,616
"⟨JANKA TIRAS⟩," zogt zi.

363
00:19:05,875 --> 00:19:09,348
"oy vey," zog ikh, "kh'hob fargesn!" nayntsn akht un draysik,

364
00:19:09,348 --> 00:19:10,892
a yor far der milkhome,

365
00:19:10,892 --> 00:19:13,766
hob ikh gehat an oysshtelung in KRAKOW fun di TEPPICHer.

366
00:19:13,823 --> 00:19:15,963
iz der foter irer geven an aynbinder,

367
00:19:15,963 --> 00:19:19,819
un bay im iz geven dray meydlekh, ⟨JANKA, LOLA⟩, un di drite gedenk ikh nisht,

368
00:19:19,819 --> 00:19:22,153
un ikh fleg geyn ahin shpiln mit im in shakhmat.

369
00:19:22,733 --> 00:19:25,851
un zi hot zikh nebekh oysbahaltn beshas der okupatsye

370
00:19:25,851 --> 00:19:27,907
⟨un zi iz⟩ gekumen oyf dem oyneg-shabes.

371
00:19:28,285 --> 00:19:31,569
shpeter, ven m'iz in KRAKOW tsu mir tsugekumen,

372
00:19:31,609 --> 00:19:35,079
 ven ikh bin, in ende milkhome

373
00:19:35,237 --> 00:19:38,212
hot men oyfgezetst oyf an eroplan fun Daytshland

374
00:19:38,212 --> 00:19:40,406
tsvey un draysik artileristn,

375
00:19:40,406 --> 00:19:43,320
un m'hot zey geshikt keyn Leningrad in a hekherer ofitsir-shul

376
00:19:43,320 --> 00:19:46,048
lernen dem, erfarung fun der milkhome.

377
00:19:46,155 --> 00:19:50,334
"Shimshen ⟨NARÓD⟩, kent avekgeyn," v⟨i⟩ mentshn zenen avekgegangen vayter.

378
00:19:50,357 --> 00:19:53,889
bin ikh geg- in dem S- in dem eroplan iz geven tsvey un draysik:

379
00:19:53,889 --> 00:19:57,793
eyn un draysik polyakim, antisemitn, un ikh bin geven der tsvey un draysikster.

380
00:19:57,883 --> 00:20:00,830
fun Leningrad hot men undz geshikt oyf, in a POLIGON,

381
00:20:01,073 --> 00:20:04,470
der grester efsher in der velt. nokh zeks khadoshim

382
00:20:04,470 --> 00:20:08,270
hob ikh gegebn a, a, a, a bakoshe

383
00:20:08,270 --> 00:20:11,026
keyn Poyln, me zol mikh lozn,

384
00:20:11,026 --> 00:20:13,970
me zol mikh lozn a khoydesh tsayt urloyb,

385
00:20:13,970 --> 00:20:15,793
vos ⟨se bakumt mir⟩ nokh der milkhome,

386
00:20:15,793 --> 00:20:19,427
in Milnitse, efsher vel ikh trefn emets⟨UNK⟩ kroyvim.

387
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:21,114
m'hot mir erloybt.

388
00:20:21,390 --> 00:20:24,560
un ikh bin gekumen keyn Lemberik fun Leningrad mitn tsug,

389
00:20:24,560 --> 00:20:28,787
hob mayn pistolet opgegebn dem komendant, ⟨hob ikh⟩ gezogt, "gib mir a tsetl,

390
00:20:28,787 --> 00:20:30,330
⟨vos dos iz mayn⟩ pistolet.

391
00:20:30,330 --> 00:20:34,761
az ikh'l hobn dem pistolet, veln mir di Ukrayner," zenen gevezn, nokh tsen yor hobn zey geharget dortn.

392
00:20:34,761 --> 00:20:36,791
nokh in a, in a poylishn mundir?

393
00:20:36,865 --> 00:20:39,322
a polyak hobn zey geharget, nokh a yid dertsu oykh!

394
00:20:39,548 --> 00:20:42,070
un ikh hob opgegebn dem pistolet. ikh bin geforn

395
00:20:42,070 --> 00:20:44,312
tsvey hundert kilometer fun Lemberik

396
00:20:44,312 --> 00:20:47,946
mit, nisht mit keyn tsug, mit a f- TOVARNe, vi me firt...

397
00:20:47,952 --> 00:20:53,050
vayl s'iz nisht geven keyn tsiger; s'iz dokh gevezn nayntsn zeks un fertsik,

398
00:20:53,050 --> 00:20:58,030
 nayntsn, finef un fertsik, detsember.

399
00:20:58,030 --> 00:21:00,460
dem nayntn may hot zikh geendikt di milkhome,

400
00:21:00,460 --> 00:21:03,540
hot men oy- oyfgezet⟨st⟩ undz un m'hot undz gefirt keyn Leningrad.

401
00:21:03,540 --> 00:21:05,850
nokh zeks khadoshim ze'mir gevorn fray.

402
00:21:05,940 --> 00:21:08,540
un, kh'bin gekumen besholem

403
00:21:08,540 --> 00:21:14,467
fun dortn efsher dray tog: m'iz geforn, m'iz dokh geshtanen, vayl s'iz nisht keyn, tsug, vi a normaler.

404
00:21:14,467 --> 00:21:17,172
gekumen keyn IVANE-PUSTE tsvey a zeyger bay nakht.

405
00:21:17,736 --> 00:21:20,640
zogn mir... shteyen zey ale mit b- gev- biksn.

406
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:25,841
keyn velder keyn groyse iz nisht, in Tarnopol iz nishto, vayl s'iz dokh shvartse erd: kleyne velder.

407
00:21:25,841 --> 00:21:28,524
v⟨i⟩ dort yidn hobn zikh bahaltn ken ikh nisht visn.

408
00:21:28,524 --> 00:21:31,651
dort hot zikh bahaltn mayne a kuzine mit a kuzen.

409
00:21:31,658 --> 00:21:34,774
er iz geshtorbn tsurik mit tsen yor, shoyn in NEW YORK.

410
00:21:34,797 --> 00:21:38,959
er iz gevorn a ALCOHOLIC vayl di Ukrayner hobn ge⟨UNK⟩ getrogn im spirt.

411
00:21:39,032 --> 00:21:42,311
er fleg kenen, heyln beheymes. a fotograf,

412
00:21:42,311 --> 00:21:44,021
hot lib gehat beheymes.

413
00:21:44,112 --> 00:21:46,673
un di kuzine, epes hot zikh oysbahaltn.

414
00:21:46,673 --> 00:21:49,736
zi voynt itster in NEW YORK. zi iz alt etlekhe un nayntsik yor.

415
00:21:49,736 --> 00:21:53,572
oyf der bar-mitsve bin ikh gevezn bay zeyer, bay an eynikl fun mayn kuzen.

416
00:21:53,983 --> 00:21:57,971
iz, zogn zey, "vu geystu? s'iz bay nakht.

417
00:21:57,971 --> 00:22:01,436
vart oys; bay tog vet forn militer, vet men dikh brengen ahin."

418
00:22:01,881 --> 00:22:03,326
zog ikh, "neyn, ikh gey."

419
00:22:03,771 --> 00:22:08,110
dort iz a mol geven HAKHSHARA fun di khalutsim ⟨bay a graf⟩.

420
00:22:08,110 --> 00:22:12,264
in gantsn a kilometer ⟨iz d-⟩ shoyn dos shtetele. IVANE-PUSTE iz di letste stantsye.

421
00:22:12,264 --> 00:22:14,480
vayl a mol fleg geyn di ban keyn Rusland.

422
00:22:14,480 --> 00:22:17,113
iz dokh geven di poylishe grenets, iz gevorn feld.

423
00:22:17,338 --> 00:22:20,651
⟨kh'gey, un⟩ fuftsik meter z- shrayt men mir, "STOY! RUKI VVERKH!"

424
00:22:20,651 --> 00:22:22,243
"halt di hent in der heykh!"

425
00:22:22,587 --> 00:22:26,614
hob ikh gehaltn di hent in der heykh. s'shteyen dray Ukrayner

426
00:22:26,721 --> 00:22:29,516
fun di NATSIONAL'Ne roybers.

427
00:22:29,758 --> 00:22:33,408
"a LYAKH!" LYAKH heyst a polyak. "o, LYAKH, ver bistu?"

428
00:22:33,408 --> 00:22:34,663
zog ikh, "Mentsher."

429
00:22:34,753 --> 00:22:36,920
"fun vanet Mentsher?" zog ikh, "fun Milnits."

430
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:38,611
"SZYMON?!" zog ikh, "yo, SZYMON."

431
00:22:39,647 --> 00:22:42,611
zogt er, "drey dikh oys!" mikh oysgedreyt.

432
00:22:42,651 --> 00:22:44,434
zey hobn dray AVTOMATn.

433
00:22:44,473 --> 00:22:48,748
zogt er, "gedenk, ze'mir gezesn dra- zibn yor oyf eyn bank in shul

434
00:22:48,748 --> 00:22:50,778
bay ZAKLIK⟨A⟩?" zog ikh, "yo, ikh gedenk."

435
00:22:50,818 --> 00:22:52,224
"host a glik."

436
00:22:52,224 --> 00:22:54,266
anisht volt ikh shoyn lang nisht gevezn.

437
00:22:54,266 --> 00:22:58,360
"vi azoy kenstu geyn a poylishn mundir, a p- a poylisher ofitsir gor?

438
00:22:58,360 --> 00:23:00,025
vi azoy iz dos epes azoy?"

439
00:23:00,370 --> 00:23:05,080
haklal, zogt er, "veyst, Dodl lebt." Dodl.

440
00:23:05,080 --> 00:23:08,059
der Dodl vos zayn eynikl hot gehat di bar-mitsve.

441
00:23:08,453 --> 00:23:12,980
Dodl iz gev- iz geven in a bekeray,

442
00:23:12,980 --> 00:23:15,956
vayl zayn dire iz geven kleyn, di bekeray iz groys.

443
00:23:16,131 --> 00:23:19,984
etlekhe un fertsik kinder vos zenen geblibn nokh der milkhome lebn

444
00:23:19,984 --> 00:23:24,060
in ale etlekhe un draysik derfer hot er genemen in der bekeray.

445
00:23:24,060 --> 00:23:28,241
aleyn iz er geven bavaksn vi a vilder mentsh, vayl er iz geven dray yor in vald,

446
00:23:28,315 --> 00:23:30,519
mit a ⟨sh-⟩ geshtanen mit a biks.

447
00:23:30,998 --> 00:23:35,008
un, un er hot, un ikh bin tsugekumen. zog ikh...

448
00:23:35,065 --> 00:23:37,373
un klap. zogt er, "ver iz dos?"

449
00:23:37,373 --> 00:23:38,687
zog ikh, "Shimshen."

450
00:23:38,997 --> 00:23:43,730
hot er gegebn a geshrey, "gevald!" un di iberike, "gevald!" ⟨zenen dokh⟩ geshlofn, ile oyfgeshtanen...

451
00:23:43,730 --> 00:23:45,423
oyf der brik zenen zey geshlofn...

452
00:23:45,423 --> 00:23:50,651
bin arayngekumen, iz a geveyn, a UNK geveyn. ⟨er iz⟩ shir nisht meshuge gevorn un ikh oykh.

453
00:23:51,062 --> 00:23:53,463
nu, ⟨s- biz s'iz⟩ gevorn tog...

454
00:23:53,463 --> 00:23:58,559
haklal, er, di, di BANDEROVTSes, di, di Ukrayner

455
00:23:58,559 --> 00:23:59,834
fun BANDERA,

456
00:23:59,834 --> 00:24:03,206
hobn geharget di rusn un di rusn hobn geharget zey.

457
00:24:03,263 --> 00:24:09,320
iz mayn kuzen hot gezogt di, di rusishe komunistn vu me ken ibershlofn yede nakht ergets andersh,

458
00:24:09,320 --> 00:24:12,510
zey zoln nisht faln keyn korbn. zey hobn im gegebn di biks

459
00:24:12,510 --> 00:24:16,470
un m'hot im oykhet a bisl gehit. nor di Ukrayner hobn zikh tsu im batsoygn gut.

460
00:24:18,450 --> 00:24:21,397
es iz shver tsu dertseyln

461
00:24:21,454 --> 00:24:24,396
az UNK tsishn Rumenyen un Poyln

462
00:24:24,396 --> 00:24:27,410
zenen dort geven di daytshn, un do zenen geven di daytshn,

463
00:24:27,410 --> 00:24:30,707
un oyf der alter grenets hot men geshtelt grenets-vakh:

464
00:24:30,707 --> 00:24:33,940
alte daytshn mit alte biksn.

465
00:24:34,414 --> 00:24:37,833
di alte daytshn zenen geven beser vi di polyakim.

466
00:24:38,076 --> 00:24:41,782
dray mol iz mayn kuzen geven in di hent fun di alte daytshn.

467
00:24:42,700 --> 00:24:45,970
⟨SAGEN⟩ zey, "HALT!" hoybt er oyf di hent.

468
00:24:46,058 --> 00:24:50,001
geyen zey tsu, zogn zey, "ACH, DU ARMER JUDE, HAB KEIN FURCHT."

469
00:24:50,091 --> 00:24:52,599
"hob nisht keyn moyre." nemen aroys GALETn...

470
00:24:52,842 --> 00:24:55,249
GALETn, UNK, azoy vi di PECHEN'⟨E⟩...

471
00:24:55,407 --> 00:24:58,568
un nemen aroys dortn, nokh epes, un me git im.

472
00:24:58,568 --> 00:25:01,284
"kenst geyn. ikh'l dikh nit rirn." dray mol.

473
00:25:01,284 --> 00:25:03,247
di alte daytshn hobn nisht gerirt.

474
00:25:03,557 --> 00:25:08,980
vos hostu gefunen fun Dinen un Rozen un Esterke?

475
00:25:08,350 --> 00:25:11,280
, koydem-kol,

476
00:25:11,472 --> 00:25:13,575
in Mi- in Kosev

477
00:25:13,767 --> 00:25:18,469
zenen gekumen di daytshn bald n- ven, onheyb fun der milkhome,

478
00:25:18,998 --> 00:25:23,382
dem zibetsetn dem tsentn, OKTYABR' nayntsn eyn un fertsik,

479
00:25:23,382 --> 00:25:26,755
un di milkhome hot zikh ongehoybn dem tsvey un tsvontsikstn dem zekstn.

480
00:25:26,862 --> 00:25:28,993
iz shoyn nisht nor in Kosev,

481
00:25:28,993 --> 00:25:31,890
iz shoyn in der gantser gegnt gevezn,

482
00:25:31,890 --> 00:25:36,260
 mit di yidn geendikt. vi azoy? Kosev

483
00:25:36,260 --> 00:25:39,379
iz eyn lange gas, hob ikh shoyn gezogt a sakh mol,

484
00:25:39,379 --> 00:25:42,093
un dort hobn gevoynt di zeks toyznt yidn,

485
00:25:42,268 --> 00:25:46,890
un di, di yidn hobn gehat a geto. zey hobn gegebn

486
00:25:46,890 --> 00:25:52,510
ot di TEPPICHer di daytshn, me zol blaybn lebn, un nokh, nokh UNK genemen frish un ⟨nokh⟩ frish.

487
00:25:52,510 --> 00:25:56,769
genug fun dem. endlekh, do, do in CHICAGO,

488
00:25:56,769 --> 00:26:00,380
di SHTEFURAK, vos kh'hob dem telefon, di adrese,

489
00:26:00,380 --> 00:26:03,030
un ikh kling ir yedes mol on, zog ikh, "SHTEFURAK,

490
00:26:03,030 --> 00:26:05,415
se mutshet aykh nisht yidish blut?"

491
00:26:05,505 --> 00:26:07,827
zogt zi, "neyn, neyn, kh'hob veynik geharget."

492
00:26:08,104 --> 00:26:10,840
zi iz geboyrn in Vin,

493
00:26:10,840 --> 00:26:14,830
vu der man irer iz geforn fun Milni- fun Kosev,

494
00:26:14,830 --> 00:26:19,660
fun, Poyln lernen meditsin. er hot khasene gehat mit der tokhter

495
00:26:19,660 --> 00:26:22,810
funem balebos, an EstrayCHerin,

496
00:26:22,810 --> 00:26:27,000
un dernokh hot er zi gebrakht aheym keyn Kosev, keyn Poyln,

497
00:26:27,000 --> 00:26:29,355
⟨un m-⟩ nayntsn yor hobn mir nisht gevust

498
00:26:29,355 --> 00:26:32,040
az zi iz a, fun EstrayCH.

499
00:26:32,040 --> 00:26:35,632
un az s'zenen gekumen di daytshn, hot zi gebrakht eyn S.S.-man,

500
00:26:35,632 --> 00:26:39,463
un m'hot organizirt bay di tsvey toyznt hutsuln

501
00:26:39,463 --> 00:26:42,570
mit zek, mit hemerlekh un meser,

502
00:26:42,570 --> 00:26:45,870
un m'hot gefirt di, kimat di zeks toyznt yidn

503
00:26:45,870 --> 00:26:49,180
oyfn Kosever barg, dort vu

504
00:26:49,279 --> 00:26:51,860
mir flegn yedn shabes geyn ahin

505
00:26:51,860 --> 00:26:55,070
oyf, leyenen a ITON,

506
00:26:55,070 --> 00:26:58,009
tantsn a hoyre, ale organizatsyes ekster:

507
00:26:58,009 --> 00:27:02,793
der Stam Khaluts ekster, Shomer Hatsair ekster, Gordonye ekster, HANOAR HATSIONI ekster.

508
00:27:02,793 --> 00:27:04,615
un m'hot tsuzamen getantst,

509
00:27:04,615 --> 00:27:08,421
un, me, yidn flegn kumen funem davenen. mir flegn kumen aheym esn,

510
00:27:08,421 --> 00:27:10,556
 shabes esn funem barg.

511
00:27:10,556 --> 00:27:14,110
der Shomer hot dokh nisht shtark, shtark gedavnt ⟨shoyn, di groyse⟩.

512
00:27:14,110 --> 00:27:15,548
genug fun dem.

513
00:27:15,800 --> 00:27:18,840
 der veg geyt azoy gedreyt, gedreyt, gedreyt,

514
00:27:18,840 --> 00:27:24,474
un dort iz gevezn ⟨dokh⟩ a g- a b- gebirg, a groyser, a groyser grub.

515
00:27:24,936 --> 00:27:28,828
un der groyser grub, iz geven durkhgeleygt a bret

516
00:27:28,969 --> 00:27:33,650
un m'hot, un m'hot oyf, dem bret zenen gegangen di mentshn,

517
00:27:33,650 --> 00:27:35,690
mit a k- hak in kop arayn

518
00:27:35,690 --> 00:27:38,420
mit a ha- mit a hak, mit a hemerl,

519
00:27:38,420 --> 00:27:39,915
⟨un zenen⟩ arayngefaln ahin.

520
00:27:40,309 --> 00:27:42,592
es iz gekumen der LINE

521
00:27:42,592 --> 00:27:45,011
fun, Simele Shtayner,

522
00:27:45,135 --> 00:27:47,795
a zekhtsn- zibetsn-yerike SHOMERET,

523
00:27:48,088 --> 00:27:51,300
un zi iz gegangen naket shoyn ahin oyf dem bret.

524
00:27:51,300 --> 00:27:54,962
zogt tsun ir eyn ESESOVETS... un zi iz geshtanen, SHTEFURAK, do...

525
00:27:54,962 --> 00:27:57,164
"bist azoy sheyn, ikh vel mit dir khasene hobn!"

526
00:27:57,164 --> 00:27:59,068
zogt zi, "kh'vel zayn zeyer tsufridn."

527
00:27:59,192 --> 00:28:02,590
un azoy vi er hot zikh farkukt vi ⟨m- di andere zenen shoyn gegangen⟩ oyf dem bret,

528
00:28:02,590 --> 00:28:04,580
hot zi im ongekhapt bay di hor,

529
00:28:04,580 --> 00:28:07,040
un hot mit di tseyn oysgebisn dos epele,

530
00:28:07,040 --> 00:28:08,930
un iz mit im arayngeshprungen in grub.

531
00:28:08,930 --> 00:28:11,180
zi iz getronken gevorn in blut,

532
00:28:11,180 --> 00:28:14,924
un er iz in a shpitol... iz geven a dokter ⟨CZISZKA⟩...

533
00:28:14,924 --> 00:28:17,580
oyf zeks, betn, nisht merer.

534
00:28:17,580 --> 00:28:20,930
er iz dortn nisht gekumen tsu zikh un hot gepeygert dortn.

535
00:28:21,518 --> 00:28:25,320
s'iz geven in Kosev a muzikant, ⟨MISZA JASIŃSKI⟩.

536
00:28:25,320 --> 00:28:28,847
er hot gehat dos hoyz tsen meter fun dem grub,

537
00:28:28,847 --> 00:28:32,213
un er hot gekukt funem shtub dort mit a lornet

538
00:28:32,213 --> 00:28:35,090
vi... "Simele Bokher" hot ⟨men im⟩ ger- hot men zi gerufn,

539
00:28:35,090 --> 00:28:38,373
vayl az zi fleg gebn a shtup a yingele, hot er nisht ⟨geshtanen oyf⟩ di fis.

540
00:28:38,373 --> 00:28:40,140
der foter iz geven a katsev,

541
00:28:40,140 --> 00:28:42,841
un di kinder zenen geven shtark, shtark gezunte kinder.

542
00:28:42,966 --> 00:28:45,376
un azoy iz Simele Shtayner

543
00:28:45,376 --> 00:28:48,410
gefaln in grub. hot mir ⟨MISZA JASIŃSKI⟩,

544
00:28:48,410 --> 00:28:52,720
nayntsn akht un zekhtsik, in Varshe iz er gekumen voynen tsu der tokhter,

545
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:55,390
un ikh bin durkh MINISTERSTVO KUL'TURY gevor gevorn

546
00:28:55,390 --> 00:28:58,943
az der ⟨MISZA JASIŃSKI⟩ iz in Varshe. er hot geshmuest hebreish un yidish,

547
00:28:58,943 --> 00:29:01,252
vayl er hot geshpilt in a yidishn orkester.

548
00:29:01,292 --> 00:29:03,513
hot er mir gezogt, "kum, vel ikh dir gebn a bild

549
00:29:03,553 --> 00:29:05,465
fun, Simele Shtayner."

550
00:29:05,465 --> 00:29:08,700
un er hot dertseylt vi azoy Simele Shtayner iz gegangen oyf kidesh-hashem,

551
00:29:08,700 --> 00:29:12,460
vi azoy zi hot ongekhapt im bay di hor un iz mit im arayngeshprungen in grub arayn.

